In another place, he tells us

00:30:55.800 --> 00:30:57.800
that the kerub

00:30:58.800 --> 00:31:00.800
is the faces of innocent little children.

00:31:02.800 --> 00:31:04.800
I think

00:31:05.800 --> 00:31:07.800
they are the angels of the Lord

00:31:08.800 --> 00:31:10.800
because they carry

00:31:11.800 --> 00:31:13.800
on earth

00:31:14.800 --> 00:31:16.800
the divine plan.

00:31:18.800 --> 00:31:20.800
That is something unique.

00:31:21.800 --> 00:31:23.800
Perhaps only you

00:31:24.800 --> 00:31:26.800
could have that time

00:31:26.800 --> 00:31:28.800
to make that lemon pie

00:31:29.800 --> 00:31:31.800
that fed that hungry man

00:31:32.800 --> 00:31:34.800
that did this, that did that

00:31:35.800 --> 00:31:37.800
that saved the universe.

00:31:38.800 --> 00:31:40.800
We don't know.

00:31:41.800 --> 00:31:43.800
You moved

00:31:44.800 --> 00:31:46.800
something in some direction.

00:31:47.800 --> 00:31:48.800
Yes?

00:31:49.800 --> 00:31:51.800
And you became the kerub

00:31:52.800 --> 00:31:54.800
that God was mounting.

00:31:55.800 --> 00:31:57.800
It is discussed by many Jewish scholars.

00:31:59.800 --> 00:32:03.800
Asher bara Elohim la'asot.

00:32:04.800 --> 00:32:07.800
The universe, the cosmos.

00:32:10.800 --> 00:32:12.800
God created it

00:32:13.800 --> 00:32:15.800
la'asot.

00:32:16.800 --> 00:32:17.800
So we do.

00:32:18.800 --> 00:32:19.800
We complete it.

00:32:20.800 --> 00:32:22.800
We carry the universe

00:32:22.800 --> 00:32:25.800
in a particular direction.

00:32:26.800 --> 00:32:28.800
And we do this

00:32:29.800 --> 00:32:31.800
by seeing something.

00:32:32.800 --> 00:32:35.800
And translate that thought

00:32:37.800 --> 00:32:40.800
into an act of loving kindness.

00:32:41.800 --> 00:32:43.800
Then we become the kerub of God.

00:32:44.800 --> 00:32:45.800
We are the keruvim.

00:32:46.800 --> 00:32:47.800
We are the angels

00:32:48.800 --> 00:32:50.800
going up and down.

00:32:51.800 --> 00:32:53.800
And this world

00:32:54.800 --> 00:32:56.800
becomes a better world.

00:32:57.800 --> 00:32:59.800
I want to illustrate

00:33:00.800 --> 00:33:02.800
my whole theory.

00:33:04.800 --> 00:33:06.800
Historical fact.

00:33:07.800 --> 00:33:11.800
People speak about Maimonides, the philosophers are nonsense.

00:33:12.800 --> 00:33:15.800
He was a physician

00:33:16.800 --> 00:33:19.800
a very wealthy and successful businessman.

00:33:20.800 --> 00:33:22.800
I think he was the wealthiest man of his time

00:33:23.800 --> 00:33:25.800
among the Jews, certainly.

00:33:26.800 --> 00:33:27.800
And

00:33:28.800 --> 00:33:30.800
there is a letter

00:33:31.800 --> 00:33:32.800
written by

00:33:33.800 --> 00:33:36.800
Chemuevi Mintibon from Provence, France.

00:33:37.800 --> 00:33:39.800
He wanted to translate, he was a translator of

00:33:40.800 --> 00:33:42.800
the Moreh Nebukhim from the Arabic into Hebrew.

00:33:43.800 --> 00:33:44.800
And he says,

00:33:45.800 --> 00:33:48.800
ask Maimonides, please I want to come to see you and speak to you.

00:33:48.800 --> 00:33:50.800
Maimonides says, no, don't come.

00:33:51.800 --> 00:33:52.800
I'm busy.

00:33:53.800 --> 00:33:55.800
And he tells him exactly what he was doing.

00:33:56.800 --> 00:33:58.800
And the most important thing for me

00:33:59.800 --> 00:34:00.800
is that after

00:34:01.800 --> 00:34:03.800
a very hard day at the palace of the king

00:34:04.800 --> 00:34:06.800
he says, I would come home

00:34:09.800 --> 00:34:11.800
and hundreds of people

00:34:12.800 --> 00:34:14.800
would be waiting.

00:34:15.800 --> 00:34:17.800
Jews, Christians

00:34:18.800 --> 00:34:21.800
pagans, there were in Egypt pagans

00:34:22.800 --> 00:34:24.800
black individuals who were taken as slaves.

00:34:25.800 --> 00:34:26.800
Jews

00:34:27.800 --> 00:34:29.800
and they're waiting for me

00:34:30.800 --> 00:34:32.800
to administer medicine to them.

00:34:33.800 --> 00:34:35.800
And Maimonides says, I will be exhausted

00:34:36.800 --> 00:34:38.800
and sometimes I have to examine the patients.

00:34:40.800 --> 00:34:43.800
While I'm lying in bed

00:34:44.800 --> 00:34:46.800
I simply don't have the energy.

00:34:47.800 --> 00:34:49.800
And Maimonides devoted

00:34:51.800 --> 00:34:53.800
the last years of his life

00:34:56.800 --> 00:34:58.800
to help people.

00:34:59.800 --> 00:35:01.800
To help people.

00:35:02.800 --> 00:35:03.800
Not Jews.

00:35:04.800 --> 00:35:05.800
Not Christians.

00:35:06.800 --> 00:35:07.800
Not Muslims.

00:35:08.800 --> 00:35:09.800
People.

00:35:11.800 --> 00:35:13.800
And he died because of this.

00:35:14.800 --> 00:35:16.800
We know exactly the situation in which he died.

00:35:17.800 --> 00:35:19.800
A plague broke in Egypt.

00:35:21.800 --> 00:35:23.800
He went out

00:35:24.800 --> 00:35:25.800
to assist his patients.

00:35:26.800 --> 00:35:27.800
Gratis, of course.

00:35:28.800 --> 00:35:29.800
He believed that

00:35:30.800 --> 00:35:32.800
medicine should be freely administered

00:35:33.800 --> 00:35:35.800
especially to the poor.

00:35:36.800 --> 00:35:38.800
He contracted whatever the plague was

00:35:39.800 --> 00:35:40.800
and he died.

00:35:41.800 --> 00:35:42.800
So

00:35:43.800 --> 00:35:45.800
I know about the other mystical schools.

00:35:46.800 --> 00:35:47.800
I still believe

00:35:48.800 --> 00:35:49.800
that there is room

00:35:50.800 --> 00:35:51.800
to investigate

00:35:52.800 --> 00:35:54.800
the mysticism of Maimonides.

00:35:55.800 --> 00:35:58.800
Post-modern rational man

00:35:59.800 --> 00:36:02.800
that knows somehow subjectively

00:36:03.800 --> 00:36:05.800
that at this moment

00:36:06.800 --> 00:36:07.800
now

00:36:07.800 --> 00:36:10.800
there is something that he, she could do

00:36:11.800 --> 00:36:13.800
that nobody else does it.

00:36:14.800 --> 00:36:16.800
The mystic is the one

00:36:17.800 --> 00:36:19.800
who grabs the now

00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:22.800
brings it down to earth

00:36:23.800 --> 00:36:24.800
and thus become

00:36:25.800 --> 00:36:26.800
the keruvim

00:36:27.800 --> 00:36:28.800
of God, the angel.

00:36:29.800 --> 00:36:31.800
Pushing, pulling this cosmos

00:36:32.800 --> 00:36:33.800
to a better destiny.

00:36:34.800 --> 00:36:36.800
Thank you for your attention

00:36:37.800 --> 00:36:39.800
and I hope I have questions.

00:36:40.800 --> 00:36:41.800
Thank you very much.

00:36:44.800 --> 00:36:46.800
I'm going to have somebody monitor the questions.

