the chariot is a matter of secrecy.

00:36:59.800 --> 00:37:01.800
Because you cannot understand

00:37:02.800 --> 00:37:03.800
who you are.

00:37:04.800 --> 00:37:05.800
Oh yes.

00:37:06.800 --> 00:37:08.800
The question that I was asked

00:37:09.800 --> 00:37:10.800
such a simple doctrine.

00:37:11.800 --> 00:37:12.800
Why is

00:37:13.800 --> 00:37:15.800
an esoteric, mystical

00:37:17.800 --> 00:37:18.800
doctrine

00:37:19.800 --> 00:37:20.800
is very important.

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:24.800
Because in order to discover yourself

00:37:26.800 --> 00:37:29.800
to discover really who you are

00:37:29.800 --> 00:37:31.800
you must transcend

00:37:34.800 --> 00:37:36.800
the world of mythology

00:37:37.800 --> 00:37:39.800
just as part of our youth.

00:37:41.800 --> 00:37:43.800
My mother is considered mythology

00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:46.800
mythological thinking

00:37:47.800 --> 00:37:49.800
part of the pagan world.

00:37:50.800 --> 00:37:51.800
We Jews

00:37:52.800 --> 00:37:54.800
also were part of pagan humanity.

00:37:55.800 --> 00:37:57.800
We say this in the night of the Seder

00:37:57.800 --> 00:37:58.800
in the night of the Seder

00:37:59.800 --> 00:38:00.800
Abadima'inu

00:38:01.800 --> 00:38:02.800
Mithila'u

00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:04.800
Abadha'zara

00:38:05.800 --> 00:38:07.800
Our ancestors also were idol worshippers.

00:38:08.800 --> 00:38:10.800
We must transcend this.

00:38:11.800 --> 00:38:13.800
There is a process

00:38:16.800 --> 00:38:18.800
and only at the end of the process

00:38:20.800 --> 00:38:22.800
after you saw the dark

00:38:25.800 --> 00:38:26.800
you realize

00:38:27.800 --> 00:38:28.800
the limits

00:38:29.800 --> 00:38:31.800
