00:38:33.800 --> 00:38:34.800
then

00:38:36.800 --> 00:38:37.800
you could

00:38:38.800 --> 00:38:40.800
begin to fathom

00:38:42.800 --> 00:38:43.800
the special world

00:38:44.800 --> 00:38:45.800
the world transcending

00:38:46.800 --> 00:38:47.800
the normative.

00:38:48.800 --> 00:38:49.800
So

00:38:50.800 --> 00:38:51.800
it is a process.

00:38:53.800 --> 00:38:55.800
And we cannot jump into it.

00:38:56.800 --> 00:38:58.800
We cannot become mystical

00:38:59.800 --> 00:39:01.800
before sharing the mythical.

00:39:02.800 --> 00:39:04.800
And we cannot become mystical

00:39:05.800 --> 00:39:07.800
before entering and exploiting

00:39:08.800 --> 00:39:10.800
and exhausting rationality.

00:39:11.800 --> 00:39:12.800
It is a process.

00:39:13.800 --> 00:39:15.800
Now, again, the process for every individual is different

00:39:16.800 --> 00:39:18.800
according to culture, mental capacity, etc.

00:39:19.800 --> 00:39:20.800
But there is a process.

00:39:21.800 --> 00:39:23.800
And this, for my manners, is the secret of the Tora.

00:39:23.800 --> 00:39:25.800
The Tora, for my manners, is the system

00:39:26.800 --> 00:39:28.800
that helps the individual

00:39:29.800 --> 00:39:30.800
from the very beginning

00:39:31.800 --> 00:39:32.800
takes him by the hand

00:39:33.800 --> 00:39:35.800
until he, she

00:39:36.800 --> 00:39:37.800
find themselves

00:39:38.800 --> 00:39:40.800
at the end of the rational world

00:39:41.800 --> 00:39:42.800
and then they have a glimpse

00:39:43.800 --> 00:39:45.800
of something beyond their rationality.

00:39:48.800 --> 00:39:49.800
I tell you why.

00:39:50.800 --> 00:39:51.800
No, I don't think

00:39:51.800 --> 00:39:53.800
Let me repeat the question.

