00:40:27.800 --> 00:40:29.800
And therefore, and only then

00:40:32.800 --> 00:40:34.800
can the light be perceived.

00:40:35.800 --> 00:40:37.800
In the scripture, there is a fantastic idea

00:40:38.800 --> 00:40:41.800
that it needs to be exploited more and more

00:40:42.800 --> 00:40:43.800
and more and more.

00:40:44.800 --> 00:40:45.800
Namely,

00:40:46.800 --> 00:40:47.800
that every person

00:40:47.800 --> 00:40:49.800
is created with the image of God.

00:40:50.800 --> 00:40:51.800
We have the image of God

00:40:52.800 --> 00:40:53.800
within us.

00:40:54.800 --> 00:40:55.800
And therefore,

00:40:56.800 --> 00:40:59.800
we don't have to annihilate ourselves.

00:41:00.800 --> 00:41:02.800
It's exactly the contrary.

00:41:03.800 --> 00:41:04.800
To develop ourselves.

00:41:05.800 --> 00:41:06.800
To know ourselves.

00:41:07.800 --> 00:41:08.800
To be

00:41:09.800 --> 00:41:10.800
in a sense like God

00:41:11.800 --> 00:41:12.800
in the sense that God is unique

00:41:13.800 --> 00:41:14.800
and to see the uniqueness of ourselves.

00:41:15.800 --> 00:41:16.800
Each one

00:41:17.800 --> 00:41:18.800
each person

00:41:19.800 --> 00:41:20.800
ever created

00:41:21.800 --> 00:41:22.800
or that will be created

00:41:23.800 --> 00:41:24.800
it has a purpose, a function

00:41:25.800 --> 00:41:26.800
that only he, she

00:41:27.800 --> 00:41:28.800
at that particular moment

00:41:29.800 --> 00:41:30.800
of history

00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:32.800
could do.

00:41:33.800 --> 00:41:34.800
And that is, makes us something

00:41:35.800 --> 00:41:36.800
which is unique by being ourselves

00:41:37.800 --> 00:41:38.800
not by annihilating ourselves.

00:41:39.800 --> 00:41:40.800
I think the difference is very important

00:41:41.800 --> 00:41:42.800
in that sense.

00:41:43.800 --> 00:41:44.800
Yes, ma'am.

